[{"text": "The assembly", "start": 1.92, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "will hear an address by his majesty", "start": 4.08, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "King Musati", "start": 8.16, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "II,", "start": 10.08, "duration": 7.119}, {"text": "head of state of the Kingdom of Esatini.", "start": 12.639, "duration": 8.161}, {"text": "I request protocol to escort his majesty", "start": 17.199, "duration": 8.681}, {"text": "and invite him to address the assembly.", "start": 20.8, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "Get your", "start": 40.879, "duration": 3.161}, {"text": "Mr. President of the General Assembly,", "start": 64.239, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "your Majesties,", "start": 68.4, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "Excellencies, Heads of State and", "start": 70.64, "duration": 3.519}, {"text": "Government,", "start": 72.4, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "Mr. Secretary General,", "start": 74.159, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 76.88, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "it is with the profound humility and", "start": 79.92, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "great privilege that I address this 81st", "start": 82.64, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "session of the United Nations General", "start": 87.36, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "Assembly.", "start": 90.4, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "We congratulate", "start": 92.079, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "the president of the 81st session on", "start": 94.4, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "assuming this office and embracing a", "start": 97.759, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "theme that is both timely and", "start": 101.6, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "imperative.", "start": 104.32, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "Restoring trust, managing", "start": 106.0, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "transformation,", "start": 108.479, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "a united Nations that delivers for all.", "start": 110.079, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "This theme speaks directly to two of the", "start": 114.56, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "most pressing questions facing the", "start": 117.36, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "international community today. First,", "start": 120.56, "duration": 8.96}, {"text": "firstly, can we restore trust in our", "start": 125.36, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "collective systems? And secondly, can we", "start": 129.52, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "manage the great transformations of our", "start": 133.68, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "time in a way that leaves no country, no", "start": 137.28, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "person behind?", "start": 141.84, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "The United Nations was born in 1945", "start": 144.16, "duration": 7.439}, {"text": "from humanity's determination", "start": 148.56, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "that the tragedies of war should never", "start": 151.599, "duration": 8.081}, {"text": "again define our common destiny.", "start": 155.36, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "Eight decades later, the world continues", "start": 159.68, "duration": 7.279}, {"text": "to look to this organization", "start": 163.44, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "as", "start": 166.959, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "as a century where nations can assembly,", "start": 168.879, "duration": 7.921}, {"text": "where differences can be resolved", "start": 173.44, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "through dialogue and where hope can be", "start": 176.8, "duration": 8.159}, {"text": "transformed into tangible action. Yet at", "start": 179.599, "duration": 8.401}, {"text": "a time when conflicts persist,", "start": 184.959, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "inequalities deepen, climate related", "start": 188.0, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "disasters intensify,", "start": 191.68, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "and countless communities continue to", "start": 194.4, "duration": 7.839}, {"text": "struggle against poverty and insecurity.", "start": 197.44, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "The international community must renew", "start": 202.239, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "its commitment to global cooperation", "start": 205.28, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "to ordinary people across the globe.", "start": 210.319, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "This assembly must not be perceived", "start": 213.44, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "merely as a forum where the world", "start": 216.799, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "discusses its problems but as an", "start": 220.319, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "organization that actively solves them.", "start": 223.519, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "The true test of international", "start": 228.159, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "cooperation is whether a child in a", "start": 231.04, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "conflict affected community can live", "start": 234.799, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "without fear. A young person can find", "start": 238.0, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "decent employment. A family can afford", "start": 241.76, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "food and a developing nation can access", "start": 245.28, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "the finance required to build its", "start": 249.12, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "future.", "start": 251.599, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "Trust among nations has eroded on", "start": 253.28, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "multiple fronts.", "start": 256.639, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Multilateral commitments have too often", "start": 258.799, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "gone unmet.", "start": 262.639, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "Financing pledges have not yet been", "start": 264.56, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "fulfilled and developing countries face", "start": 267.36, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "trillions of dollars in annual", "start": 271.12, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "investment gaps to achieve the", "start": 274.24, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "sustainable development goals.", "start": 276.96, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "Furthermore, billions of people reside", "start": 281.36, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "in countries where governments are", "start": 284.72, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "forced to spend more on debt servicing", "start": 288.56, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "than on health care or education.", "start": 291.84, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "Restoring trust cannot be achieved", "start": 295.759, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "through declarations alone. It requires", "start": 298.56, "duration": 8.479}, {"text": "that uh promises already made be honored", "start": 302.479, "duration": 8.081}, {"text": "and that our institutions demonstrate", "start": 307.039, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "the capacity and will have to respond to", "start": 310.56, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "changing global realities.", "start": 314.0, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "Since the Isuluini consensus was adopted", "start": 316.96, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "in 2005,", "start": 320.16, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "sadly Africa still has no permanent seat", "start": 322.56, "duration": 10.44}, {"text": "on the UN Security Council. And yet", "start": 327.28, "duration": 5.72}, {"text": "and yet the continent", "start": 334.72, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "the continent remains a global strategic", "start": 337.6, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "partner in the world stage. The question", "start": 340.4, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "is, how many more years should African", "start": 344.4, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "leaders travel to New York and stand", "start": 348.0, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "before this assembly to call for a fair", "start": 351.6, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "representation", "start": 355.68, "duration": 6.12}, {"text": "in the UN Security Council.", "start": 357.199, "duration": 4.601}, {"text": "Mr. President, we are being deprived of", "start": 365.039, "duration": 8.321}, {"text": "the opportunity to contribute to global", "start": 369.36, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "security issues.", "start": 373.36, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "We meet at a time when multiple wars and", "start": 376.16, "duration": 8.96}, {"text": "armed conflicts continue to claim lives,", "start": 380.16, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "destroy infrastructure,", "start": 385.12, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "and displace communities across various", "start": 387.28, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "regions of the world.", "start": 390.24, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Beyond the immediate human tragedy,", "start": 392.88, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "these conflicts exert a heavy economic", "start": 396.24, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "toll. They divert resources that are", "start": 399.52, "duration": 7.679}, {"text": "urgently needed for development into", "start": 403.84, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "military expenditure.", "start": 407.199, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "They also drive up energy and", "start": 409.68, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "transportation cost, disrupt global", "start": 411.919, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "supply chains, and ex excessate the", "start": 415.68, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "rising cost of living felt by people", "start": 419.599, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "everywhere.", "start": 423.36, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "Peace remains the indispensable", "start": 425.36, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "foundation upon which all development is", "start": 428.96, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "built.", "start": 433.12, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "Where there is war, development is", "start": 435.039, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "reversed.", "start": 437.599, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "Where there is instability, investment", "start": 439.039, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "withdraws.", "start": 442.16, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "Where there is fear, human potential is", "start": 443.759, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "lost.", "start": 447.84, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "The Kingdom of Esatini remains deeply", "start": 449.52, "duration": 8.239}, {"text": "concerned by the continued conflict and", "start": 453.52, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "humanitarian crisis affecting various", "start": 457.759, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "parts of our world.", "start": 460.56, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "We call for the continued pursuit of", "start": 463.52, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "diplomatic and political solutions to", "start": 467.039, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "these conflicts.", "start": 470.24, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "While war may create temporal victories", "start": 472.24, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "on the battlefield, only through", "start": 475.68, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "dialogue can sustainable peace be", "start": 478.319, "duration": 6.44}, {"text": "established.", "start": 481.759, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "The United Nations must remain the place", "start": 487.12, "duration": 8.96}, {"text": "where the door to dialogue never closes.", "start": 491.52, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "On the African continent, continued", "start": 496.08, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "instability", "start": 498.8, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "validates the urgent need to strengthen", "start": 500.479, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "African-led peace processes.", "start": 503.68, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "There's also a need to support the", "start": 506.72, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "capacity of African regional", "start": 509.12, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "organizations to prevent conflict,", "start": 511.84, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "mediate disputes, and build sustainable", "start": 515.039, "duration": 7.081}, {"text": "peace.", "start": 519.12, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "The Kingdom of Swadini believes firmly", "start": 522.56, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "that", "start": 525.279, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "peace in Europe, Middle East and Africa", "start": 526.959, "duration": 8.801}, {"text": "must be echoed in preventing diplomacy", "start": 531.68, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "fully supported by the United Nations.", "start": 535.76, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "We call upon the UN to ensure that", "start": 539.44, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "countries respect peace agreements that", "start": 544.0, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "have been signed to avoid drawing back", "start": 547.12, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "on the gains already made, thus causing", "start": 550.88, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "more destruction to infrastructure and", "start": 554.32, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "innocent lives.", "start": 557.839, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "The UN should provide oversight to", "start": 560.24, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "ensure follow-ups and monitor compliance", "start": 564.8, "duration": 8.4}, {"text": "on these agreements to last forever.", "start": 568.48, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "During the 46th", "start": 573.2, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Sardak Summit, Esatini assumed the", "start": 575.519, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "chairmanship of the Sardak organ on", "start": 579.2, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "politics, defense and security", "start": 581.68, "duration": 8.279}, {"text": "cooperation troa whose", "start": 584.399, "duration": 5.56}, {"text": "whose mandate is to promote peace and", "start": 591.36, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "stability in the southern African", "start": 595.68, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "region.", "start": 598.88, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Through this uh responsibility,", "start": 600.64, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "we will work closely with all member", "start": 604.0, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "states to strengthen preventative", "start": 607.12, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "diplomacy,", "start": 610.24, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "enhance dialogue and mediation.", "start": 611.76, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "We believe that uh for Saddak to attain", "start": 615.839, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "its vision 2050,", "start": 618.8, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "we have to create a peaceful,", "start": 621.68, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "competitive and industrialized region", "start": 624.24, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "that guarantees sustainable well-being", "start": 627.519, "duration": 8.281}, {"text": "and freedom for all our citizens.", "start": 630.64, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "The African Union's agenda 2063 and its", "start": 638.64, "duration": 9.84}, {"text": "aspiration to silence the guns reflect", "start": 644.079, "duration": 8.561}, {"text": "our continent's resolve to end conflict", "start": 648.48, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "and create the s and to create the", "start": 652.64, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "stable conditions required for", "start": 656.24, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "sustainable growth. However, we are", "start": 659.04, "duration": 8.64}, {"text": "concerned by the continued incidents of", "start": 662.88, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "unconstitutional", "start": 667.68, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "changes of government which run counter", "start": 669.44, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "to the values and principles enshrined", "start": 673.04, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "in the charters of the United Nations,", "start": 677.2, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "the African Union and the original", "start": 680.56, "duration": 6.519}, {"text": "economic blocks.", "start": 683.279, "duration": 3.8}, {"text": "Respect for constitutional", "start": 687.2, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "order and the rule of law is fundamental", "start": 690.16, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "to stability.", "start": 693.839, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "We urge the international community to", "start": 695.68, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "speak with one voice against its", "start": 698.959, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "erosion.", "start": 702.0, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "The United Nations should fully support", "start": 703.76, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "decisions taken by regional bodies to", "start": 706.399, "duration": 7.921}, {"text": "condemn such acts which cause immense", "start": 710.8, "duration": 7.279}, {"text": "sufferings and uncertainty for millions", "start": 714.32, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "of people.", "start": 718.079, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Sustainable development must remain at", "start": 720.24, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "the center of our collective endeavor.", "start": 724.079, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "The promise of the sustainable", "start": 728.32, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "development goals SDGs", "start": 731.12, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "is a pledge that no person and no", "start": 734.16, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "country should be left behind. Yet", "start": 737.6, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "developing countries continue to face", "start": 741.2, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "significant challenges including limited", "start": 744.72, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "access to finance, technology,", "start": 748.16, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "infrastructure, health care, education", "start": 751.279, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "and productive investment.", "start": 754.48, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "Economic development must increasingly", "start": 758.0, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "mean the structural transformation of", "start": 761.68, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "our economies.", "start": 764.56, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "We need to shift from the exportation of", "start": 766.48, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "unprocessed raw materials to value", "start": 770.399, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "addition, local industrialization, and", "start": 772.959, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "the creation of decent jobs within our", "start": 776.399, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "own borders.", "start": 779.44, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "This economic growth", "start": 781.76, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "objective is now", "start": 784.639, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "inseparable from the emerging", "start": 787.2, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "technologies.", "start": 789.68, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "The transformation brought about by", "start": 791.44, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "digitalization and artificial", "start": 794.32, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "intelligence presents enormous", "start": 796.48, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "opportunities for humanity.", "start": 799.76, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "It is it has the power to expand access", "start": 802.88, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "to education, health care, financial", "start": 807.2, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "services and economic opportunities.", "start": 810.0, "duration": 8.959}, {"text": "However, innovation must be governed by", "start": 814.8, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "responsibility", "start": 818.959, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "and accountability.", "start": 820.56, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "Emerging technologies, particularly", "start": 823.04, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "artificial intelligence, are advancing", "start": 826.48, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "faster than uh our current capacity to", "start": 829.44, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "govern them while retaining human agency", "start": 832.8, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "and control.", "start": 836.639, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "This raises critical questions regarding", "start": 838.72, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "accountability,", "start": 842.959, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "safety, environmental", "start": 844.48, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "impact and the risk of a widening", "start": 847.199, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "digital divide between those who can", "start": 850.639, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "shape these technologies and those who", "start": 854.0, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "are excluded from their benefits. In", "start": 857.68, "duration": 5.8}, {"text": "total,", "start": 860.48, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "the Kingdom of Swatini remains", "start": 865.519, "duration": 7.921}, {"text": "committed to building a more resilient,", "start": 869.6, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "diversified", "start": 873.44, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "and inclusive economy.", "start": 874.959, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Our vision is to create an economy that", "start": 877.92, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "generates decent employment, attracts", "start": 880.959, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "sustained investment,", "start": 885.12, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "expands opportunities for our youth,", "start": 887.519, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "women and marginalized groups amongst", "start": 890.24, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "others to strengthen their livelihoods.", "start": 893.199, "duration": 8.161}, {"text": "To this end, we continue to invest", "start": 897.839, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "strategically in human capital,", "start": 901.36, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "infrastructure,", "start": 905.12, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "health care, education, agriculture,", "start": 906.639, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "tourism, industrialization", "start": 910.56, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "and digital development, mining while", "start": 913.519, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "positioning esatini effectively within", "start": 916.8, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "regional and global value chains.", "start": 920.079, "duration": 7.601}, {"text": "We appeal to the UN for support towards", "start": 923.44, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "enhancing the capacity of African", "start": 927.68, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "countries in developing value addition", "start": 930.88, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "on their natural resources as well as", "start": 934.72, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "creating a trading hub for precious and", "start": 938.16, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "earth minerals and other commodities for", "start": 942.48, "duration": 6.68}, {"text": "the continent.", "start": 945.92, "duration": 3.24}, {"text": "In this regard,", "start": 951.36, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "the African continental free trade area", "start": 953.519, "duration": 10.161}, {"text": "provides a vital platform for African", "start": 959.6, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "nations to move beyond raw material", "start": 963.68, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "exports towards greater value addition,", "start": 967.04, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "industrial processing and intra African", "start": 970.56, "duration": 9.199}, {"text": "trade so as to fulfill our vision.", "start": 974.639, "duration": 7.921}, {"text": "No country can achieve sustainable", "start": 979.759, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "development while large segments of its", "start": 982.56, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "population remain on the margins of the", "start": 986.32, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "economic mainstream.", "start": 990.079, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "Our citizens must not be viewed merely", "start": 992.16, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "as beneficiaries of employment. They", "start": 995.92, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "must be full participants as key pillars", "start": 999.199, "duration": 8.44}, {"text": "of our sustainable growth.", "start": 1002.959, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "We have uh created an inclusive", "start": 1009.839, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "environment for all our people", "start": 1013.04, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "irrespective of their gender or religion", "start": 1016.72, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "at the apex of our economic growth", "start": 1020.32, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "strategy.", "start": 1023.36, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "Economic and social progress however", "start": 1025.28, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "remain vulnerable to global health", "start": 1028.959, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "crisis.", "start": 1032.0, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "The coid9 pandemic taught humanity a", "start": 1033.679, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "vital lesson. No country can protect", "start": 1037.919, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "itself from a global health emergency", "start": 1040.959, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "alone.", "start": 1044.64, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "Yet even as we recover from that crisis,", "start": 1046.48, "duration": 9.28}, {"text": "recent resurgences of impulse, recurring", "start": 1051.44, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "Ebola outbreaks, and other emerging", "start": 1055.76, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "infectious diseases remind us that our", "start": 1059.52, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "health system must remain vigilant and", "start": 1062.559, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "resilient.", "start": 1066.48, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "We must decisively address persistent", "start": 1068.16, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "inequalities in access to vaccines,", "start": 1071.84, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "medicines, and medical technologies.", "start": 1074.64, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "Critical, the international community", "start": 1078.4, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "must support African countries in", "start": 1080.559, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "developing robust local and regional", "start": 1084.0, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "capacities to manufacture essential", "start": 1086.88, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "pharmaceuticals and health products.", "start": 1090.4, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "In a recent meeting of the East, Central", "start": 1094.24, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "and Southern African Health Community", "start": 1097.6, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "Conference held in Eswatini,", "start": 1100.88, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "the country's resolve to act as a", "start": 1104.32, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "singular block when purchasing essential", "start": 1108.0, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "drugs and medical supplies.", "start": 1111.84, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "This will help reduce cost and ensure", "start": 1115.44, "duration": 8.68}, {"text": "supply chain stability.", "start": 1119.84, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "We appeal to the UN through the World", "start": 1126.48, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "Health Organization to support this", "start": 1130.32, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "endeavor.", "start": 1133.36, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Parallel to health, security is the", "start": 1135.28, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "fundamental crisis of climate change", "start": 1138.48, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "which is another defining challenge of", "start": 1142.24, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "our generation.", "start": 1145.12, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "Developing countries contribute minimal", "start": 1147.28, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "to global emissions yet bear the brunt", "start": 1150.16, "duration": 8.639}, {"text": "the brunt of uh droughts, floods,", "start": 1155.44, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "shifting weather patterns and climate", "start": 1158.799, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "induced shocks.", "start": 1161.52, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "Therefore, climate action must be", "start": 1163.76, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "accompanent by climate justice.", "start": 1166.48, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "We call for stronger international", "start": 1170.08, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "cooperation in climate adaptation,", "start": 1172.72, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "resilience, technology transfer,", "start": 1176.48, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "capacity building, and access to", "start": 1179.6, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "predictable, affordable climate finance.", "start": 1182.24, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "We must protect our environment, not", "start": 1186.96, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "only for our present generation, but for", "start": 1190.0, "duration": 8.679}, {"text": "those yet unborn.", "start": 1194.0, "duration": 4.679}, {"text": "In our region, we are currently", "start": 1201.52, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "confronted by what has been predicted as", "start": 1204.559, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "one of the most severe El Nino weather", "start": 1208.24, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "patterns on record. Addressing this", "start": 1211.679, "duration": 8.401}, {"text": "requires us to draw deeply upon strained", "start": 1215.52, "duration": 8.64}, {"text": "national resources to protect our people", "start": 1220.08, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "and preserve their livelihoods.", "start": 1224.16, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "Directly linked to climate resilience is", "start": 1228.0, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "our commitment to food security.", "start": 1230.96, "duration": 8.4}, {"text": "Our national objective is to ensure that", "start": 1235.12, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "every family has access to sufficient,", "start": 1239.36, "duration": 7.679}, {"text": "safe and nutritious food. This is a", "start": 1243.12, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "matter of basic human dignity and", "start": 1247.039, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "sustainable development.", "start": 1249.76, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "To achieve this, we are intensifying", "start": 1252.72, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "investment in agriculture,", "start": 1255.919, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "modern farming technologies, research,", "start": 1258.96, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "infrastructure, and the and the", "start": 1263.12, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "empowerment of our smallh holder", "start": 1265.76, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "farmers.", "start": 1268.32, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "We continue to provide subsidies for", "start": 1269.919, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "farming inputs and implements to support", "start": 1273.36, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "sub substances farmers.", "start": 1277.44, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "Furthermore, we have embarked on a major", "start": 1280.88, "duration": 7.679}, {"text": "dam construction projects for irrigation", "start": 1284.48, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "which are set to transform our", "start": 1288.559, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "agricultural landscape particularly in", "start": 1292.08, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "the law field.", "start": 1294.88, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "National endeavors such as this are", "start": 1297.039, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "greatly enhanced by international", "start": 1300.32, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "cooperation.", "start": 1302.799, "duration": 3.841}, {"text": "The partnership between the United", "start": 1304.559, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "Nations and the Kingdom of Esatini has", "start": 1306.64, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "been instrumental in advancing our", "start": 1310.799, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "national development aspirations and", "start": 1314.159, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "implementing the and implementing the", "start": 1317.44, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "SDGs.", "start": 1320.559, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "This collaboration spans critical", "start": 1322.64, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "sectors including health, tourism,", "start": 1325.52, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "education, agriculture, and renewable", "start": 1328.0, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "energy. We deeply value this uh", "start": 1331.2, "duration": 7.359}, {"text": "partnership and remain committed to", "start": 1335.039, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "ensuring a strong and enduring United", "start": 1338.559, "duration": 7.441}, {"text": "Nation United Nations presence in our", "start": 1342.559, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "country, including the establishment of", "start": 1346.0, "duration": 9.32}, {"text": "a permanent UN home in Eswati.", "start": 1348.96, "duration": 6.36}, {"text": "Just as partnerships at home are vital,", "start": 1357.6, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "so is inclusive participation on the", "start": 1362.0, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "international stage. Taiwan", "start": 1365.44, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "plays a vital role in global supply", "start": 1369.44, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "chains. It has much to contribute to the", "start": 1372.4, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "international community and can play a", "start": 1377.36, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "highly meaningful role in building a", "start": 1380.64, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "sustainable future for humanity. The", "start": 1383.679, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "United Nations should seek appropriate", "start": 1387.36, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "ways to facilitate Taiwan's sub", "start": 1390.48, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "substantive participation", "start": 1394.24, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "in UN meetings and activities, enabling", "start": 1396.799, "duration": 7.921}, {"text": "it to share its expertise and actively", "start": 1400.88, "duration": 9.48}, {"text": "engage with the international partners.", "start": 1404.72, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 1414.08, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "as we convene at this pital", "start": 1416.08, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "pivotal moment in the life of the United", "start": 1420.4, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "Nations,", "start": 1424.08, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "let us remember that our differences", "start": 1425.76, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "need not prevent us from finding common", "start": 1429.12, "duration": 8.4}, {"text": "ground. The world does not require", "start": 1432.96, "duration": 8.4}, {"text": "perfect consensus on every issue. It", "start": 1437.52, "duration": 7.279}, {"text": "needs the courage to identify areas", "start": 1441.36, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "where cooperation is possible and will", "start": 1444.799, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "and and the will to act upon them. Let", "start": 1448.96, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "us restore faith in diplomacy and", "start": 1452.799, "duration": 7.601}, {"text": "dialogue. Let us reestablish", "start": 1456.559, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "trust in international cooperation and", "start": 1460.4, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "above all reaffirm our belief that", "start": 1463.44, "duration": 7.359}, {"text": "humanity's shared challenges can be", "start": 1467.52, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "addressed when nations chooses", "start": 1470.799, "duration": 7.24}, {"text": "cooperation over division.", "start": 1473.52, "duration": 4.519}, {"text": "The United Nations must remain a house", "start": 1479.919, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "where every nation, large or small, has", "start": 1484.24, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "a voice and where the sovereignty and", "start": 1487.919, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "dignity of all member states are fully", "start": 1491.76, "duration": 6.44}, {"text": "respected.", "start": 1495.2, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "As world leaders,", "start": 1499.36, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "we come here every year to promote", "start": 1501.919, "duration": 8.161}, {"text": "dignity, peace, justice, humanity, and", "start": 1505.36, "duration": 7.439}, {"text": "cooperation in order to create a better", "start": 1510.08, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "world. And we should never give up to", "start": 1512.799, "duration": 7.561}, {"text": "fight for it.", "start": 1516.559, "duration": 3.801}, {"text": "The Kingdom of Esatini", "start": 1521.6, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "stands ready to work with all member", "start": 1523.919, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "states. the United Nations system,", "start": 1527.6, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "regional organizations, and", "start": 1531.279, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "international partners to advance peace,", "start": 1533.52, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "dialogue, sustainable development and", "start": 1537.6, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "human dignity for all. We take this", "start": 1541.36, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "opportunity to extend our appreciation", "start": 1545.12, "duration": 7.919}, {"text": "to all UN agencies and the support", "start": 1549.2, "duration": 7.359}, {"text": "structures for their diligent work in", "start": 1553.039, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "ensuring the success of this g of of", "start": 1556.559, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "this gathering and execution of their", "start": 1560.159, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "various duties. I thank you. May", "start": 1563.679, "duration": 7.961}, {"text": "almighty God bless us all.", "start": 1566.88, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "On behalf of the assembly,", "start": 1575.679, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "I wish to thank the head of state of the", "start": 1578.72, "duration": 7.319}, {"text": "kingdom of Esatini.", "start": 1581.6, "duration": 4.439}]